cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SiMetrics, please cite the paper listed under preferred-citation."
title: "SiMetrics: A Reliability Benchmark for Power Distribution Maintenance"
abstract: >-
  A fully reproducible, physics-informed simulator and dataset for benchmarking
  machine-learning methods on medium-voltage distribution feeders, scored on the
  reliability metrics utilities care about (SAIFI/SAIDI, IEEE 1366). Built entirely
  on public test networks and synthetic, standards-anchored physics.
